  "description": "Brienne, stripped of her title by her cousin and on the verge of being sold to an ugly, middle-aged nouveau riche, runs away disguised as a man, only to find herself in dire straits. The only job she can find is a butler position for the infamous Duke of Connaught! \n\n*\"A whopping two gold pieces a week!\"*\n\nIt was too much to refuse. She tried her best to avoid Duke Connaught's notice and just save up enough money to escape, but \"You're cute.\" For some reason, it seems the Duke has taken notice of her.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
